<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-World Series tournament standings.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-World Series tournament standings.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in the World Series limited overs tournament after Sunday's match:</p>
<p>		   Pl   W    L   Pts</p>
<p> West Indies   7    5    2   10</p>
<p> Pakistan	6    3    3    6</p>
<p> Australia     7    2    5    4</p>
<p>Next match: Jan 14, Sydney - Pakistan v West Indies.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
